{"title":"고추밭에서 만나요!","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=srLFq/dJMcagxEjGo/aibkQjNVBZ9vk9cRdAiV7K&filename=th3","synopsis":"재벌가의 고명딸 태미는 신사업을 여러 번 말아먹은 것도 모자라, SNS 무개념 게시물(?)로 대형 사고를 일으킨다.\n결국 분노한 아버지의 명령으로 고추의 고장 수창리로 좌천되는 태미. 도시력 만렙인 태미는 눈 앞에 펼쳐진 깡촌에 절규했으나,\n고추밭 끝자락 물레방앗간에 사는 청년 농부이자 절세미남 강훈을 만나 단숨에 의욕을 충전하게 되고,\n급기야 우연히 목격한 강훈의 튼실한 하체와 미모에 반해 자숙은 커녕 단숨에 강훈에게 적극적으로 대쉬하기 시작하는데...!\n\n매콤달콤 산지직송 농촌 로맨스!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":260,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":246,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":258,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":251,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":261,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":262,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":261,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":270,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":251,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":289,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":225,"change":{"type":"up","amount":64}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":279,"change":{"type":"down","amount":54}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":237,"change":{"type":"up","amount":42}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":242,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":254,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":261,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":275,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":275,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":282,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":286,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":281,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":283,"change":{"